  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colleen Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:03:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:03:35-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, this is Colleen Lynch. I know it's after five and City Hall's closed, but I saw this number was the storm line. I'd like to report that my elderly neighbor can't get out, the plow left a wall of snow at the end of her walk and she needs a path cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:03:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm glad you called the storm line. Let me get that down. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "163 Bacheller Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "163 Bacheller Street. And the snow is from the plow at the end of her walkway, is that right? This is left over from the storm Sunday into Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:04:11-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The snow turned to rain and then it all froze up into heavy chunks. She can't get through it. I would have shoveled it myself, but it's like concrete. I'm a renter next door, and I only noticed because I was out front waiting for the bus this morning. I sketch people on the bus, so I'm usually looking around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:04:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. So an elderly neighbor, she's stuck behind the plow ridge at 163 Bacheller. Do you want a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:04:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195. Got it. I'll log it now and send it to the crews as a priority path request. Can you please make sure she's got somebody checking on her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:04:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thank you. Please log it, that's all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T17:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's logged. Take care, Ms. Lynch."
    }
  ],
